    note: >-
      Just six weeks removed from dropping The Big Dirty (September 4, 2007),
      unleashing instant pit anthems like "We’rewolf" and "No Son of Mine" in
      sweaty clubs.
  - band: Poison the Well
    note: >-
      Touring their raw, Swedish-recorded Ferret Music album Versions (April
      2007), pushing well past their early metalcore blueprint into bleak,
      atmospheric heavy rock.
  - band: Maylene and the Sons of Disaster
    note: >-
